      </div>
      <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Do you meet Norwegian quality standards?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">Yes. We maintain OEKO-TEX certification, REACH compliance, and quality control processes meeting Norwegian fashion industry standards.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">What documents do I need to import to Norway?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">Required documents include commercial invoice, packing list, bill of lading, certificate of origin, and EFTA GSP proof of origin. We also provide REACH compliance certificates.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Do you comply with Norwegian textile labeling requirements?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">Yes. We provide compliant labeling with Norwegian-language care instructions and EU standard fiber content declarations meeting Norwegian regulations.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="border-top:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Does Norway get the same EU GSP duty-free benefit as EU member states?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">No — Norway is not an EU member and has its own separate trade arrangements (through EFTA and Norway's own GSP scheme) rather than the EU's GSP/EBA terms. We calculate Norway-specific duty rates separately in every quote rather than assuming EU terms carry over.</p>
      </div>
    
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

